# S-042 obscore: the runner #includes libobs/obs.c, obs-canvas.c, obs-view.c, obs-display.c; real video-io.c /
# audio-io.c / format-conversion.c / video-frame.c, obs-data.c, signal/proc/calldata/decl, task queue, profiler,
# uuid and platform layer are linked. Graphics, graphics thread, hotkeys and the source/output/encoder/service
# object layer are fakes in obscore_stubs.c. Unreached cross-file symbols (source save/load, audio monitoring,
# GPU encoding...) are left unresolved on purpose.
